WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.350
A jacket costs fifty pounds.

2
00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:06.450
In the spring, the shop puts
the price up by twenty per cent.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.050
In the summer sale, the shop
brings the price down by twenty

4
00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:10.730
per cent.

5
00:00:10.780 --> 00:00:13.990
Up twenty per cent, then
down twenty per cent.

6
00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:17.270
So is the jacket back to fifty pounds?

7
00:00:17.320 --> 00:00:21.110
In this mission, you'll spot when
two amounts are in direct or

8
00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.380
inverse proportion.

9
00:00:22.430 --> 00:00:24.850
You'll find a percentage of an amount,

10
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:28.090
and work out percentage
increases and decreases.

11
00:00:28.140 --> 00:00:32.010
And you'll calculate simple
interest on savings.

12
00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:35.510
Your mission: find out whether
the jacket is back to fifty

13
00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:36.580
pounds.
